        "title": "The three pictures show the position of a volcano, and a village before and after volcanic eruption. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main points and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y3fjd7zNHo2BNwxlRWplqxy2gce\"><em><strong>The three pictures show the position of a volcano, and a village before and after volcanic eruption. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main points and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Volcano Position and Village Before/After Eruption</em></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i <em>Volcano Position and Village Before/After Eruption</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về vị tr&iacute; của một ngọn n&uacute;i lửa v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh một ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng gần đ&oacute; qua 2 giai đoạn:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<ul>\n<li>H&igrave;nh 1: Vị tr&iacute; n&uacute;i lửa (Position of volcano)</li>\n<li>H&igrave;nh 2: L&agrave;ng trước khi n&uacute;i lửa phun (Village before volcanic eruption)</li>\n<li>H&igrave;nh 3: L&agrave;ng sau khi n&uacute;i lửa phun (Village after volcanic eruption)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Volcano Position and Village Before/After Eruption với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: vị tr&iacute; địa l&yacute; của n&uacute;i lửa - sự biến đổi của ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng gần đ&oacute; trước v&agrave; sau khi n&uacute;i lửa phun tr&agrave;o.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Thay đổi 1:</strong> Ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng trải qua những thay đổi đ&aacute;ng kể sau vụ phun tr&agrave;o</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Thay đổi 2:</strong> Sự chuyển từ trạng th&aacute;i kh&ocirc;ng hoạt động sang hoạt động của n&uacute;i lửa g&acirc;y ra sự t&agrave;n ph&aacute; đ&aacute;ng kể cho cả nh&agrave; cửa v&agrave; thảm thực vật xung quanh</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i theo 2 kh&iacute;a cạnh ch&iacute;nh: (1) N&uacute;i lửa v&agrave; d&ograve;ng chảy dung nham, (2) Sự thay đổi của ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng v&agrave; địa h&igrave;nh.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Trước khi phun tr&agrave;o (H&igrave;nh 1 &amp; 2)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả vị tr&iacute; n&uacute;i lửa:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">N&uacute;i lửa nằm tr&ecirc;n <em>một h&ograve;n đảo biệt lập (an isolated island)</em>, được <em>bao quanh ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n bởi biển (entirely surrounded by the ocean)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng trước khi phun tr&agrave;o:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><em>Liền kề với n&uacute;i lửa (adjacent to the volcano)</em>, một ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng nhỏ</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng bao gồm <em>nhiều ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; (multiple houses) xen kẽ với một số c&acirc;y dừa (interspersed with several palm trees)</em> rải r&aacute;c khắp khu vực</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">(Step 3)<strong> Nhận x&eacute;t tổng quan về khu định cư:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1.5 [li_&amp;]:gap-1.5 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-2 pl-8 mb-3\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">C&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng tr&igrave;nh v&agrave; c&acirc;y cối c<em>hiếm một phần đ&aacute;ng kể của h&ograve;n đảo (occupied a substantial portion of the island)</em></li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Cho thấy một khu định cư<em> tương đối đ&ocirc;ng đ&uacute;c v&agrave; ph&aacute;t triển (a relatively dense and thriving settlement) </em>trước khi c&oacute; hoạt động n&uacute;i lửa</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> Sau khi phun tr&agrave;o (H&igrave;nh 3)</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1)<strong> M&ocirc; tả trạng th&aacute;i n&uacute;i lửa v&agrave; d&ograve;ng dung nham:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Sau vụ phun tr&agrave;o, n&uacute;i lửa <em>trở n&ecirc;n được k&iacute;ch hoạt (became active)</em></li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><em>Dung nham n&oacute;ng chảy (molten lava)</em> chảy xuống từ <em>miệng n&uacute;i lửa (crater)</em> xuy&ecirc;n qua ng&ocirc;i l&agrave;ng.</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Dung nham cuối c&ugrave;ng <em>chảy đến bờ biển (reaching the coastline)</em>, nơi n&oacute;<em> tạo th&agrave;nh một hồ lớn (formed a large pool)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2)<strong> M&ocirc; tả thiệt hại về nh&agrave; cửa:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Những ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; nằm trực tiếp tr&ecirc;n<em> đường đi của d&ograve;ng dung nham (in the path of the lava flow)</em> bị ph&aacute; hủy ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Điều n&agrave;y l&agrave;m <em>giảm đ&aacute;ng kể tổng số nh&agrave; ở trong khu vực (significantly reducing the overall number of dwellings)</em></li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, những ng&ocirc;i nh&agrave; <em>nằm xa d&ograve;ng dung nham (away from the lava stream) </em>vẫn c&ograve;n <em>nguy&ecirc;n vẹn (remained intact)</em> v&agrave; <em>kh&ocirc;ng bị ảnh hưởng (unaffected)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">(Step 3)<strong> M&ocirc; tả thiệt hại về thảm thực vật:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1.5 [li_&amp;]:gap-1.5 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-2 pl-8 mb-3\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Tương tự, một số lượng đ&aacute;ng kể c&acirc;y dừa <em>bị ti&ecirc;u diệt (eliminated)</em> bởi d&ograve;ng dung nham</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Trong khi đ&oacute;, những c&acirc;y ở <em>khu vực kh&ocirc;ng bị ảnh hưởng (unaffected areas) </em>vẫn sống s&oacute;t sau vụ phun tr&agrave;o</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2864,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">The given pictures illustrate the position of a volcano and the transformation of a nearby village before and after a volcanic eruption.</p>",
            "question_id": 37172,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2865,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ORkTdZ3r9oS5aGxZdgll13pYgze\">\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Overall, the village underwent significant changes following the eruption. Most notably, the shift from a dormant to an active state of the volcano resulted in considerable destruction to both the residential buildings and the surrounding natural vegetation.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37172,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2866,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<p>Looking at the first two diagrams, the volcano was positioned on an isolated island entirely surrounded by the ocean. Adjacent to the volcano, a small village was established, comprising multiple houses interspersed with several palm trees scattered throughout the area. These residential buildings and tropical trees occupied a substantial portion of the island, suggesting a relatively dense and thriving settlement prior to the volcanic activity.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37172,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2867,
